      "provider": {
        "name": "deepseek-tri",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "mode": "json_single"
      },
      "summaries": {
        "en": "Hivemind is a shared memory and coordination layer for AI agents, solving the problem of isolated agents that lack context about each other's actions. It uses a centralized 'brain' to store agent memories, skills, and tool definitions, enabling agents to learn from past interactions and collaborate. Technically, it provides a REST API and client SDKs for agents to log experiences and query relevant memories. Developers can integrate it with any agent framework (e.g., Claude, Codex) to build multi-agent systems that share knowledge and avoid redundant work.",
        "zh": "Hivemind是一个开源项目，为AI代理提供共享记忆与协调能力，解决多代理缺乏上下文感知的问题。它通过中央“大脑”存储代理的记忆、技能和工具定义，使不同代理能从彼此历史交互中学习并协同工作。技术上，Hivemind提供REST API和客户端SDK，代理可记录经验并查询相关记忆。开发者可将其与任何代理框架集成，构建共享知识、避免重复工作的多代理系统，适合需要长期记忆和团队协作的AI应用场景。",
        "es": "Hivemind is a shared memory and coordination layer for AI agents, solving the problem of isolated agents that lack context about each other's actions. It uses a centralized 'brain' to store agent memories, skills, and tool definitions, enabling agents to learn from past interactions and collaborate. Technically, it provides a REST API and client SDKs for agents to log experiences and query relevant memories. Developers can integrate it with any agent framework (e.g., Claude, Codex) to build multi-agent systems that share knowledge and avoid redundant work.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "hivemind stands out for ai, ai-agents, and ai-memory in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Hivemind is a shared memory and coordination layer for AI agents, solving the problem of isolated agents that lack context about each other's actions. It uses a centralized 'brain' to store agent memories, skills, and tool definitions, enabling agents to learn from past interactions and collaborate. Technically, it provides a REST API and client SDKs for agents to log experiences and query relevant memories. Developers can integrate it with any agent framework (e.g., Claude, Codex) to build multi-agent systems that share knowledge and avoid redundant work.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/activeloopai/hivemind for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
